<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1361476" n="1"/>
  <p><lb/><abbr>Illustr.</abbr> et Pereximio Viro <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolao Bernoulli</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Petrus <abbr>Ant.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr> Michelotti.</rs></p>
  <p>Te bene valere tuisque studiis operam dare
      <lb/>haud ambigo Vir Amicissime. Ego quoque optima
      <lb/>fruor valetudine, et <add>strenue</add> pergo in coagmentatione
      <lb/>me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> ridicul<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> opell<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>. Mitto ad Te corrigenda
      <lb/>qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Te absente scripsi. Quam primum ea cor<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rexeris ut remittas rogo, c<subst><del>l</del><add>u</add></subst>rando ne perdan<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tur. <rs key="place_GEO-3173435" type="place">Mediolano</rs> <rs key="biblio_WIW87HR7" type="biblio">Dissertationem</rs> <abbr>Celeber.</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patrui</rs>
      <lb/>Tui heri tandem accepi <subst><del>cum</del><add>un<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice></add></subst> <subst><del><gap/></del><add>cu</add></subst>m Tui <rs type="person">Patruelis</rs>
      <lb/><rs type="lostletter">epistola</rs><note type="comment">Michelotti erhielt mit Johann I Bernoullis Dissertation <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_WIW87HR7"><hi rend="i">De nutritione</hi></rs> ein Schreiben eines Vetters Nicolaus I Bernoullis und leitete es an diesen weiter. Das Schreiben ist bislang nur indirekt bezeugt.</note>, quam a <abbr>D.</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1221327275" type="person">Marchione Butintro<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>chi</rs> apertam inadvertenter<supplied>,</supplied> ad Te mitto.
      <lb/><del>E </del>Cum rescribes ad <rs type="person">Patruelem</rs> saluta ipsum
      <lb/>meo nomine, dicque illi falsissim<subst><del>us</del><add><choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></add></subst> esse
      <lb/><abbr>Nobiliss.</abbr> <abbr>D.</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1178493288" type="person">Mariam Labia</rs> suam incomparabi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lem pulchritudinem amisisse, eamque
      <lb/>inpresentiarum formosiorem, pulchriorem,
      <lb/><del>que </del>magisque nutritam existere atque
      <lb/>ab omni <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>gritudine immunem.</p> <closer><salute>Vale</salute> Vir
      <lb/>Doctissime indicaque mihi alios, si qui sunt,
      <lb/>de lingua latina scriptores ab istis latini
      <lb/>sermonis Professoribus adhibitos. <dateline>Dabam
      <lb/><rs key="place_VER-repven" type="place">Venetiis</rs> <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>a dato</expan></choice> <date when="1718-10-16">16 Octobr. 1718.</date></dateline></closer>
    <lb/><note hand="pers_DE-588-119166895"><foreign xml:lang="ger"><abbr>Empf.en</abbr> den <date when="1718-10-17">17<hi rend="sup">ten</hi></date>.</foreign></note>
</div>
</body>
